---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Welcome
description: A vibrant Orthodox Christian parish on the Kitsap Peninsula in Washington, just north of Poulsbo.
permalink: /
---

<section class="hero" style="--banner: url('/assets/img/photos/banner-home.jpg')">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="hero-tagline">Orthodox Church in America &middot; Poulsbo, Washington</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Welcome!</h2>
        <p>
          We are delighted that you found our website. We hope you enjoy reading through it and sampling
          some of our homilies, talks, and music.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have questions about our parish&mdash;or would like to speak to a priest&mdash;our rector
          {{ site.rector }} is available at all times to do so. You can reach him at
          <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or
          <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Join Us!</h2>
        {% include "partials/service-times.njk" %}
        <p class="small">
          This schedule changes during certain seasons of the church year.
          See our <a href="/resources/dates-and-events/">calendar of feasts and fasts</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Becoming Orthodox</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>New to Orthodoxy?</h3>
        <p>
          Orthodox Christianity is the faith of the Apostles, handed down in an unbroken tradition from
          the first century to the present.
        </p>
        <p><a class="card-link" href="/who-we-are/our-faith/">Our Faith &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Visiting for the first time</h3>
        <p>
          What to expect when you arrive, how our services unfold, and the coffee hour and pot-luck that
          follow every Sunday Liturgy.
        </p>
        <p><a class="card-link" href="/come-and-see/visiting/">Visiting &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Becoming Orthodox</h3>
        <p>
          From inquirer to catechumen to sacramental reception&mdash;the path many of our parishioners
          have already walked.
        </p>
        <p><a class="card-link" href="/come-and-see/becoming-orthodox/">Becoming Orthodox &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Can't be here in person?</h3>
        <p>
          Each Sunday we stream the Divine Liturgy live on YouTube for members, guests, and those who are
          homebound.
        </p>
        <p><a class="card-link" href="/resources/streaming/">Watch online &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set upcoming = feasts.dates | limit(6) %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Parish Calendar</h2>
    <ul class="calendar">
      {% for item in upcoming %}
        <li>
          <time datetime="{{ item.date }}">{{ item.date | feastDate }}</time>
          <span>{{ item.title }}</span>
          <span class="tag tag-{{ item.kind }}">{{ item.kind }}</span>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;"><a class="text-link" href="/resources/dates-and-events/">Full calendar of feasts and fasts &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if collections.news.length %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Parish News</h2>
    <ul class="news-list">
      {% for post in collections.news | limit(4) %}
        <li>
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
          <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
          {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;"><a class="text-link" href="/news/">All news &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Directions</h2>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-inline: auto;">
      <p>
        Saint Elizabeth Orthodox Church is located {{ site.address.directions | replace("Just", "just") }}
        Our address is <strong>{{ site.address.street }}</strong>, {{ site.address.city }},
        {{ site.address.region }} {{ site.address.postalCode }}.
      </p>
      <p><a class="button" href="{{ site.address.mapsUrl }}" rel="noopener">Open in maps</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
